    "body": "## What\n\nRemove the deadsnakes PPA source list from the ROCm image at the start of the Mooncake build step.\n\n## Why\n\nThe nightly `gfx950-rocm724` build failed in [this run](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39597874446) after about 2.4 hours of AITER compilation: Launchpad returned 503 for the deadsnakes PPA index, so `apt update` in the Mooncake step exited with 100.\n\n```\nE: Failed to fetch https://ppa.launchpadcontent.net/deadsnakes/ppa/ubuntu/dists/noble/main/binary-amd64/Packages  503  Service Unavailable\nE: Some index files failed to download. They have been ignored, or old ones used instead.\n```\n\nThe PPA comes from the `rocm/pytorch` base images. Nothing in `rocm.Dockerfile` installs from it: the Python in each base image is the distro default (3.10 on jammy, 3.12 on noble), and the later apt installs only pull distro packages such as `python3-dev`.\n\n## Notes for the reviewer\n\n- The removal is at the top of the RUN rather than just before `apt update`, because Mooncake's `dependencies.sh` runs its own `apt-get update`.\n- It runs regardless of `BUILD_MOONCAKE` and is not restored afterwards. That way the later `apt-get update` steps (TileLang, MORI, NIXL) are covered too. As a side effect, the published image no longer has the deadsnakes PPA configured.\n- `rm -f` with the glob is a no-op on bases that don't have the PPA (the ROCm 10 base is plain `ubuntu:24.04`).\n\n## Test plan\n\nNot yet verified: this needs a ROCm image build. I haven't dispatched one because the release workflow pushes images.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #39664217914](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39664217914)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39664217795](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39664217795)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #39664217973](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39664217973)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
